  "content": "<p><strong>你被困在一个拥有巨大森林的暮色领域，无法返回主世界。你能否在这个地方探索自己的旅程，并与那里的危险怪物战斗？<br></strong>这个整合包旨在为旧电脑提供良好的性能，主要目标是探索暮色森林维度。<br>故事以英文和葡萄牙语编写（enUS, ptBR）<span><br></span></p>\n<p><strong>特性：<br></strong>制作魔法地图，查看此处的地牢和Boss<br><span>使用冒险背包模组，你可以携带出色的背包探索维度，并制作强大的小工具<br></span><span>你可以使用铁箱模组和铁熔炉模组制作优质的箱子和熔炉<br></span><span>你起始时会拥有一个传送石和一个折跃石，以便快速回家或拜访朋友的家<br><br><br></span></p>\n<p><strong>模组列表-</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/startinginventory\" rel=\"nofollow\">StartingInventory</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventure-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adventurebackpack<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ai-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\">AI_Improvementes<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterfps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Betterfps<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-options/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default Options</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fastcraft</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/foamfix-optimization-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">FoamFix</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gravestone-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">GraveStone</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron-Chests<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces</a> <br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lockdown\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lockdown</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughitems\" rel=\"nofollow\">NotEnoughItems</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/perfect-spawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">PerfectSpawn</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">SoundFilters<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-forest-portal-catalyst\" rel=\"nofollow\">TwilightForestPortalCatalyst</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">TwilightForest</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer\" rel=\"nofollow\">VeinMiner</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's_Minimap<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Worldmap</a><br><br>其他模组-<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bspkrscore\" rel=\"nofollow\">BspkrsCore</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/codechickencore\" rel=\"nofollow\">Codechickencore<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mantle<br></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>整合包的地图是预设好的<br>如果你的游戏出现卡顿，我建议你下载Optifine模组<br>我无法制作服务器版本，而且我认为这个整合包在服务器上无法正常运行。</p>",
